messages "tats**To: haploSubj: tatsuoCc: sauron,exos,tuppence,jewel,danielle,daniella,figleaf,jimpa,kovalev,nemchinov,nae,peraphon,cara,pretzel,ren,salesman,blade,unuscione,wilbie,waldo,trout,dragonn,darastor,baer,boadicea,goolag,akira,beardy,muesli,patience,dalamar,gandalfDate: Jul 22Dear Friend,      It has been 8 months since i was taken away from you by acomment made in ignorance.  I wanted to make this request of all of you.  I am sorry if i could not included everyone as I brought upmost of your names from memory.      I was removed banished because Herp was told on the wizline by Leslie that It was me who had altered his prison file.Leslie said this because i was mentioning the abuse of theprison file earlier that day.  I have made almost no attemptto reinstate my self in the last few months but I am comingto the point where I really miss being here and talking with mostof you.  When I was here I made a difference.  I want to do so againMy life has settled down and I am no longer in transition.  I holdthe postion of General Manager and Partner of Hawk Manufactured Housingbased in Warren PA and have recently opened the 5th Sanchin Karate Academy there.  But anyway.I have sent mail to Herp explaning everything that transpired and tryingto clear up the whole mess.  I need support.I would like to ask each and every one of you to mail a short messageto Herp.  Say what you can.  If only that you believe what happened was a mistake and you would like to see Tatsuo unbanished.I am counting on each one of you.  I hthink I have helped each one of you over the years and I REALLY WANT TO COME BACK.please drop me a mail if you sent something so i can keep track.Thank You,         David Grant Goodman, AKA Tatsuo           814-226-7228**tatsuo**To: haploSubj: ezoCc: sauron,mangla,silas, trout, akira, unuscione,jewelDate: Jul 29REquesting write access to patience directory.Objective: TO recode ezo and oriental areas of mud.Area to include: Ezo, Ishikawa, Iheya-Shima, unuscione's island,                 possible areas from akira and trout.Guilds involved: Ninja, Samurai(to be recoded), Wu-Jen (to be proposed)                  and Psionisist (trout/akira)People: Tatsuo, Akira, Haplo, Trout, Unuscione, and other wiz with        these interests in mind.Requirements:  I will  need general access to several directories               and at least Lord status returned.  These wizards               have worked as a team for over a year, some longer               than that (peers at haplo).  Team coding is the	        best possible way i can see to accomplish long	        term projects without usual procrastination.	        The synergy between elements allows leverage 	        for each element to accomplish his own goals.IMHO: Beelzebub is not fit for the position handed to him, it ispossible to restore the old ninja guild if we find ONE file.That file is nskills.h (NOT THE VERSION IN DICE DIRECTORY)Give me some time i will find out if I can buy the disk from Gambit, or, request herp check for backups of HM from 1993Thank you gentlemen for your consideration. The longer you ponder, the longer it takes us to complete.Tatsuo**smurf**To: thormSubj: SCHOOL IS IN!!!Cc: demolian,marco,cara,hootie,kutya,docreason,tsubaki,sipher,gorlin,wa, joyful, dreamer,exos,unuscioneDate: Aug 26HI GUYS AND GIRLS!!!!I am finally back to school and boy have i missed you all!!!My e mail address hasn't changed....so MAIL ME!!S_mlkilgore@vaxa.clarion.eduTalk to you all soon!!!!!Love and miss you all!!!Smurf(Michelle)**jewel**To: unuscioneSubj: heyaDate: Sep  1I saw that you were on today!You didn't reply to my mail! :(Are you mad at me?How was your summer?  I hope you had a good one :)Take care,Heather**heavenly**To: panoramixSubj: CoriCc: unuscioneDate: Sep 19I can be reached at telnet roa.sunyit.edu 4000 on most Monday's thru Friday's.It is called